    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Delta is a visual novel about adventures in a strange world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a traveler from a distant space, coming from the universe, or time, or death. Then you accidentally fell into this world - a world based on a triangular pyramid. With a bewildered mood, a local resident named Anthony discovered you and traveled with you in this world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will encounter various creatures trapped in their own mental dilemmas, witness a plethora of illogical and stream-of-consciousness language, collect all kinds of strange items and interact with NPCs in various ways. Players can see different endings in different routes, witness the decline of this world - and, enjoy this moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698820/extras/8b2ef4bace27925c3f2cc0577667357c.avif?t=1750502241\" width=243 height=123 /></span></p>",
